senses
  entry
    definition "consider in detail and subject to an analysis in order to discover essential features or meaning"
    examples ("analyze a sonnet by Shakespeare" "analyze the evidence in a criminal trial" "analyze your real motives")
    id oewn-00646245-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (analyze analyse study canvass)
  entry
    definition "observe, check out, and look over carefully or inspect"
    examples ("The customs agent examined the baggage" "I must see your passport before you can enter the country")
    id oewn-02135744-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (see)
  entry
    definition "question or examine thoroughly and closely"
    id oewn-00790226-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (probe)
  entry
    definition "question closely"
    id oewn-00788478-v
    partOfSpeech v
  entry
    definition "put to the test, as for its quality, or give experimental use to"
    examples ("This approach has been tried with good results" "Test this recipe")
    id oewn-02537291-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (test prove try "try out" essay)
